{"unit_id":"tag:0261:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n等价地，我们可以要求存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0001>，其中商（quotient）<MATH_0002> 按《群胚（Groupoids）》的第 <REF_0001> 节定义。为了构造代数空间（algebraic spaces），我们将研究逆向问题，即哪些等价关系（equivalence relations）的商（quotient）层（sheaf）<MATH_0003> 是代数空间（algebraic space）。最终将证明，只要 <MATH_0004> 是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation），定义在 <MATH_0005> 上且以 <MATH_0006> 为基底，就总是如此，见定理 <REF_0002>。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"equivalence relations","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"表示的等价表述；未批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"待研究的构造；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"引用章名；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"欲构造的对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalence relations","target_term":"等价关系","context":"商的输入；未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"商的类型；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"商所需满足的性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"关系的性质，保留原重音；未批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系","context":"足够条件中的关系；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
